      "id": "weekly-upstream-20261101",
      "notes": "User-file GoogleVideoMetadata Codable type and validated start/end/fps mapping on inline/hosted/provider-reference inputs with endpoint namespace precedence and gateway fallback. Close streamed continued JSON strings on final chunk, empty chunk and valueless string terminator. Map Gemini 3 none to the lowest level with compatibility warning; Gemini 2.5 Pro minimum reasoning budget128; max reasoning uses shared95-percent budget cap. Native apiKeyProvider refreshes HTTP authorization before each send/stream, including continuations, batches, file initiation/polls and Interactions. Reviewed upstream: @ai-sdk/google 4.0.105 to 4.0.109. Validation passed: node Scripts/test-packages.mjs (all 52 owning package suites and the compatibility facade); node Scripts/sdk.mjs generate --check; node --test Scripts/tests/*.test.cjs (27 passed); docs-site check and build (100 pages). Live provider calls were not run.",
      "compatibility": "Minor release for additive native API; existing static settings and call sites remain compatible. Updated direct dependency minimums are recorded in the manifest. Existing documented JS/framework and native product gaps remain; version-delta review does not imply full parity or live-service testing. Explicit custom authentication skips an unused credential supplier, a deliberate native callback-order adaptation."
    }
  ],
